From 5b64553b277352c5802a6bfceaf5722e36e5791b Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Shammah Chancellor <shammah.chancellor@notvalid.com>
Date: Thu, 15 Oct 2026 15:03:06 -0700
Subject: [PATCH] feat(v2): add bounded negotiated transaction relay engine

Maintenance explanation added during mailbox export:
Introduce transaction inventory, request and response handling behind explicit peer feature negotiation, with bounded retained state, retry work and missing-parent handling. Standalone relay tests exercise the engine and session contract without claiming a deployed transaction network.

